      "date": "2025-11-30T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Tilaknagar Industries Ltd. (BSE:507205) completed the acquisition of Imperial Blue business division of Pernod Ricard from Pernod Ricard India (P) Ltd. for approximately INR 34.4 billion.",
      "body": "Tilaknagar Industries Ltd. (BSE:507205) agreed to acquire Imperial Blue business division of Pernod Ricard from Pernod Ricard India (P) Ltd. for an enterprise value of INR 4.5 billion on July 23, 2025. The consideration includes deferred payment of INR 2.82 billion, to be paid four years after the date of closure of the transaction. The lump sum consideration is subject to the adjustments in accordance to the terms and conditions of the Business Transfer Agreement. The proposed transaction includes acquisition of the Imperial Blue division, with 22.4 million 9-litre cases sold in the year ended March 2025 across India and other markets, including two owned units and services from co-manufacturing bottlers across India. The transaction will be financed through equity investment of INR 25 bi",
